# lists3 — a reliable queue with LMOVE
#
# Learn: with a plain RPOP, a job disappears from Redis the moment a
# worker takes it; if the worker crashes, the job is lost. LMOVE src dst
# RIGHT LEFT pops from src and pushes onto dst in one atomic step, so the
# job sits in a "processing" list until the worker removes it (LREM).
#
# Task: producers LPUSH onto queue:pending, so the oldest job is at the
# right end. Take the oldest job and move it to the head of
# queue:processing, atomically. Don't hard-code job names: the check runs
# this against different queues.
#

RPOP queue:pending
LPUSH queue:processing job:1
